 materials—brass, copper, and acacia wood—that not only look beautiful but also add character, tradition, and authenticity to your home décor.<\/p><p><strong>Q3. Are Pillow Fights products a good gift?<\/strong><\/p><p>A: Absolutely! From handcrafted brass God statues and all-natural wooden utensils to copper serveware, our home décor accessories are a thoughtful gift for housewarming gifts, festive occasions, weddings, or special Diwali gifts.<\/p><p><strong>Q4. Do you offer accessories for pooja?<\/strong><\/p><p>A: Yes! You can browse our Pooja Collection of curated handcrafted brass God idols, pooja thalis, sacred accessories, and more—for rituals, festivals, or even everyday devotion.<\/p><p><strong>Q5. Can I shop online for Pillow Fights products?<\/strong><\/p><p>A: Yes! All of our handcrafted trays, bowls, idols, utensils, and décor accessories are available to browse and purchase on the Pillow Fights website. We package products safely and ship them across India to ensure everything arrives in perfect condition.<\/p>"}},"richtext_nMfEVR":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p><strong>Popular searches : <\/strong><\/p><p>Shop by Category : <a href=\"https:\/\/pillowfights.co.in\/collections\/god-statue\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">God Statue<\/span><\/a> , <a href=\"https:\/\/pillowfights.co.in\/collections\/timber-luxe\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Wooden Kitchen Utensils<\/span><\/a> , <a href=\"https:\/\/pillowfights.co.in\/collections\/copper-cure\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Copper Utensils<\/span><\/a>,  <a href=\"https:\/\/pillowfights.co.in\/collections\/pooja-collection\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">pooja Accessories<\/span><\/a> , <a href=\"https:\/\/pillowfights.co.in\/collections\/copper-bottle\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Copper Bottle<\/span><\/a><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_iXcPYh","richtext_DtaFUG","subheading_wWqCPf","richtext_md9nQA","heading_QYa9rd","subheading_ypWCNx","richtext_WhGCrm","subheading_bQmwpb","richtext_7V7MiH","subheading_Dy3L9w","richtext_miGdEr","subheading_AqqEnw","richtext_Efk9nF","subheading_AtBgiT","richtext_AnVFVC","heading_pqrX9F","richtext_6yqEyn","subheading_8yLbMW","richtext_3XHkdG","subheading_rCUPpC","richtext_CpJrkM","heading_xQmqXg","richtext_eypiQ9","heading_rK8XYG","richtext_DxeCLx","heading_Kn3wC6","richtext_kUMgaQ","richtext_nMfEVR"],"disabled":true,"name":"Seo Content Meta Data","settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-ac07a60c-aa0c-42de-86a5-319cfe6f874c","separate_section_with_border":true,"content_width":"lg","text_position":"start","remove_vertical_spacing":false}},"custom_liquid_KD4fKA":{"type":"custom-liquid","name":"Seo Content Meta Data Through COde","settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"remove_vertical_spacing":true,"remove_horizontal_spacing":true,"liquid":"<div class=\"collection-seo-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"collection-seo-container\">\n    <div class=\"collection-seo-metadata\" id=\"seoContent\">\n\n      <h1>Pillow Fights — Home Décor Accessories with Timeless Charm<\/h1>\n      <p>Welcome to Pillow Fights - where craftsmanship intersects with comfort and design lives with purpose. We design and handcraft home décor accessories that nestle beautifully in your home and warm your day-to-day rituals. Serving trays and bowls, idols, statues, and kitchen items are designed and produced to thoughtfully add charm, style and comfort; timeless in spirit, made to be enjoyed over-and-over again.<\/p>\n\n      <h2>A soft signature based on craft<\/h2>\n      <p>Our design is about balance, where tradition meets contemporary living. Each piece has the hand of the artist behind it, using natural materials like brass, copper, and acacia wood. We think about accessories as being intimate; objects with meaning, memory, embedded in the rhythm of your home.<\/p>\n      <p>Colors stay grounded, forms stay purposeful, and textures tell the story of the hand that made them. Whether for your pooja room, dining table, or living space, our creations are designed to be discovered up close, not loudly announced, but quietly cherished.<\/p>\n\n      <h2>Explore our signature categories<\/h2>\n\n      <h3>Handcrafted Brass God Statues<\/h3>\n      <p>Bring sacred charm into your home with handcrafted brass God statues. Perfect for pooja rooms, festive décor, or thoughtful Diwali gifts, each idol reflects devotion, artistry, and timeless elegance.<\/p>\n\n      <h3>Handcrafted Wooden Kitchen Utensils<\/h3>\n      <p>Our handmade wooden kitchen utensils are convenient, beautiful, and durable, designed to last. From a chopping board to serving spoons, these utensils bring natural beauty and warm charm to all your kitchen traditions.<\/p>\n\n      <h3>Handcrafted Copper Utensils<\/h3>\n      <p>Celebrate tradition with copper. Explore thalis, jugs, bowls, and serveware, crafted for durability, festive elegance, and everyday use. Each piece adds richness to your table while carrying the heritage of Indian craft.<\/p>\n\n      <h3>Pooja Accessories<\/h3>\n      <p>Explore our specially curated collection of Pooja Accessories. Lovingly handcrafted for bringing a sense of peace and ritual into your spiritual spaces.<\/p>\n\n      <h3>Copper Bottles<\/h3>\n      <p>Stay connected to wellness with our selection of Copper Bottles. Functional, stylish and surrounded by traditional health benefits, these bottles elevate hydration with beauty and function every day.<\/p>\n\n      <h3>Wall Art<\/h3>\n      <p>The proper Wall Art can change the mood of any place, whether it's your living room, bedroom, office, or café. Our selection has a wide range of distinctive styles that are inspired by travel, nature, city life, and modern design. Each piece is carefully chosen to add style, warmth, and character to your walls while still meeting the Pillow Fights brand's high design standards.<\/p>\n\n      <h2>Materials we trust<\/h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Acacia Wood:<\/strong> Organic, sturdy, and friendly for knives, designed to endure through every slice, serve or stir.<\/li>\n        <li><strong>Brass:<\/strong> Rooted in tradition, bright finish, and sign of commitment.<\/li>\n        <li><strong>Copper:<\/strong> Timeless, durable, and treasured for its natural benefits.<\/li>\n      <\/ul>\n      <p>We prioritize natural finishes, hand-done detailing, and durable construction—so every piece holds its beauty through daily use.<\/p>\n\n      <h2>The uniqueness of Pillow Fights: Handcrafted details worth noticing<\/h2>\n      <p>Every accessory is made with care, edges are smoothed, finishes are polished and shapes are designed to balance function and beauty. Whether the curve of the bowl is gentle or the copper is softly shiny or the overall proportions are pleasing to the eye, these decorative details are intended to infuse your spaces and rituals.<\/p>\n\n      <h2>Where to place Pillow Fights<\/h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Everyday living:<\/strong> Wooden kitchen tools that serve and chop and stir with ease.<\/li>\n        <li><strong>Celebration:<\/strong> Copper thalis and bowls that carry tradition into your festive occasion.<\/li>\n        <li><strong>Sacred home:<\/strong> Brass God statues and pooja accessories that place God in the center of your devotion.<\/li>\n        <li><strong>Gifting:<\/strong> Beautiful, handcrafted pieces that bring warmth into another's home.<\/li>\n      <\/ul>\n\n      <h2>The Pillow Fights home<\/h2>\n      <p>She has a love for craft, comfort and beauty, equally. She likes the parts that feel personal—objects that tell stories, objects that have meaning. Objects that layer quietly into her space. Her home is deliberate, timeless in sentiment, and filled with things intended to be used, loved, and remembered.<\/p>\n\n      <h2>Discover the art of living well<\/h2>\n      <p>Everything you see at Pillow Fights is thoughtfully designed to marry tradition and modern living with care, rooted in heritage, as a way to enrich your everyday life. Trays, bowls, idols, utensils, bottles, and accessories, grouped together in one promise: to make your home more beautiful, soulful, and undoubtedly yours.<\/p>\n\n      <h2>FAQs – Pillow Fights Home Décor Accessories<\/h2>\n\n      <p><strong>Q1. What sets Pillow Fights' home décor accessories apart?<\/strong><br>\n      At Pillow Fights, each item is handcrafted with care using natural products—brass, copper, and acacia wood. We truly focus on timeless design, quality craftsmanship, and thoughtful details to enhance the feel and beauty of your home.<\/p>\n\n      <p><strong>Q2. Do you use natural materials for your products?<\/strong><br>\n      Yes! We rely on natural, durable materials—brass, copper, and acacia wood—that not only look beautiful but also add character, tradition, and authenticity to your home décor.<\/p>\n\n      <p><strong>Q3. Are Pillow Fights products a good gift?<\/strong><br>\n      Absolutely! From handcrafted brass God statues and all-natural wooden utensils to copper serveware, our home décor accessories are a thoughtful gift for housewarming gifts, festive occasions, weddings, or special Diwali gifts.<\/p>\n\n      <p><strong>Q4. Do you offer accessories for pooja?<\/strong><br>\n      Yes! You can browse our Pooja Collection of curated handcrafted brass God idols, pooja thalis, sacred accessories, and more—for rituals, festivals, or even everyday devotion.<\/p>\n\n      <p><strong>Q5. Can I shop online for Pillow Fights products?<\/strong><br>\n      Yes! All of our handcrafted trays, bowls, idols, utensils, and décor accessories are available to browse and purchase on the Pillow Fights website. We package products safely and ship them across India to ensure everything arrives in perfect condition.<\/p>\n\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<style>\n.collection-seo-wrapper {\n  width: 100%;\n  margin: 40px auto 60px;\n  padding: 0 20px;\n}\n\n.collection